:''This article's name is not official.''
'''Origin Base''' is an [[Enemy Bases|Enemy Base]] introduced in [[Revival of Origin]], the final stage of [[Uncanny Legends]]. It was added in [[Version 12.0 Update|Version 12.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Origin Base
|image = E 632.png
|first appearance = '''UL''': [[Revival of Origin|Sub-chapter 49 - Revival of Origin]]
|money drop = N/A
}}

==Enemy==
Despite its special treatment as an animated base, it does absolutely nothing. It is only distinct in its immunity to [[Surge Attack]]s, which is meaningless as regular bases are already immune to Surge.

