==Trivia==
*The Origin Base looks like a more intact version of the [[Media:Rc117.png|first enemy base]] seen in [[Uncanny Legends]], albeit with brighter, animated [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] power, the [[Sacred Forest]]'s roots around it, and [[Zero Luza]]'s symbol as a motif instead of [[Relic Doge]] heads.
*The Origin Base and [[Parasol Base (Enemy Base)|Parasol Base]] currently the only Animated Enemy Bases to be immune to [[Surge Attack]]s.

